   "d": "2022-01-20",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Avingtrans PLC (AIM: AVG), which designs, manufactures and supplies critical components, modules, systems and associated services to the energy, medical and industrial sectors, is pleased to announce business in the first half of the financial year has remained strong and the Company is trading in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20220120_AVG_Trading-Update,-Notice-of-Results-and-Investment.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-23",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Timing of contract revenue recognition has provided management with good visibility over H2 2022 revenue, despite some Covid-19 induced order delays and the Board is therefore cautiously optimistic in achieving full year market expectations.",
   "file": "20220223_AVG_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-07",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board is pleased to report that the results for the year ended 31 May 2022 are expected to be in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20220707_AVG_Trading-Update-and-Notice-of-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-09-28",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In the quarter since 31 May 22 the Group has generally performed as expected",
   "file": "20220928_AVG_Preliminary-results-for-the-year-ended-31-May-2022.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-01-16",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Avingtrans PLC (AIM: AVG), which designs, manufactures and supplies critical components, modules, systems and associated services to the energy, medical and industrial sectors, announces that trading in the first 6 months of the financial year to 30 November 2022 was in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20230116_AVG_Trading-Update,-Acquisitions-and-Notice-of-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-22",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Strong order intake and timing of contract revenue recognition has provided management with good visibility over H2 2023 revenue and profits, on-going supply chain disruptions notwithstanding. Therefore, the Board remains cautiously confident about achieving full year market expectations.",
   "file": "20230222_AVG_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-07-13",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board is pleased to report that the results for the year ended 31 May 2023 are expected to be in line with market expectations*.",
   "file": "20230713_AVG_Trading-Update-&-Possible-Acquisition-of-Adaptix.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-09-27",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "In the quarter since 31 May 2023, the Group has performed in line with management expectations with the momentum of FY23 continuing into FY24",
   "file": "20230927_AVG_Preliminary-results-for-the-year-ended-31-May-2023.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-01-18",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "I am pleased to announce that the Group's trading performance for the first half of the year is in line with the Board's expectations and, we are comfortable in achieving market expectations for FY24.",
   "file": "20240118_AVG_Trading-Update-and-Notice-of-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Thus, the Board continues to be confident about our  expectations for the full year and views the future positively.",
   "file": "20240228_AVG_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-06-19",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 3,
   "q": "Adjusted EBITDA from continuing operations is materially ahead of market expectations* and is expected to be in the range of £13-14m. This was in part due to lower than budgeted commercialisation costs in the Medical Division, some of which have been delayed in to FY25.",
   "file": "20240619_AVG_Trading-Update-and-Notice-of-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-09-25",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY25",
